<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-RAMAYANA H1 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-RAMAYANA H1 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			61.00	 vs     33.92</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  174	  vs	194</p>
<p>    Net sales			554.46	 vs    433.89</p>
<p>    Operating profit		63.76	 vs     49.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  76.80	 vs     44.84</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    129.34	 vs     37.37</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Ramayana Lestari Sentosa is one of Indonesia's largest retailers.</p>
